OL,3,GNEWSAFake CV doctor struck off after
OL,4,ANHS hospital job
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor, who worked for an NHS
OL,7,Fhospital trust after making a
OL,8,F"wholesale fabrication" of his CV, has
OL,9,Fbeen struck off.
OL,11,FDr Tochukwu Akah admitted more than 20
OL,12,Ffalse claims, including pretending to
OL,13,Fhave worked as a chief medical officer
OL,14,Fin Nigeria, the Medical Practitioners
OL,15,FTribunals Service (MPTS) said.
OL,17,FIt was "fortuitous" that no patients at
OL,18,FHampshire Hospitals NHS Foundation
OL,19,FTrust were harmed, the panel heard.
